3.47   A third party defendant may do one or more of the
following:
(a) apply to the Court to set aside service in accordance with
rule 11.31;
(b) apply to the Court for an order under rule 3.68 with
respect to the third party claim;
(c) apply to the Court for an order under rule 3.68 with
respect to the plaintiff’s statement of claim;
(d) file a statement of defence or demand for notice.

